      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "לנגיד",
      "rationale": "נגיד bɛ se ka kɛ ɲɛmɔgɔ walima masakɛ ye; dɔnniyaw bɛ a fɔ 'prince' walima 'ruler' — ne ye ɲɛmɔgɔ ta"
